["I need to make 24 using 8, 5, 5, 9 with each number used once.\n\nLet me try combinations.\n\n8, 5, 5, 9\n\nLet me think:\n- 9 - 5 = 4, 5 - ... hmm\n- 5 + 5 = 10, 10 - 8 = 2, 2 + 9 = 11. No.\n- 9 + 5 = 14, 14 + 5 = 19, 19 + 8 = 27. No.\n- 8 * 5 = 40, 40 - 9 = 31, 31 - 5 = 26. No.\n- 9 * 5 = 45, 45 - 8 = 37, 37 - 5 = 32. No.\n- 5 * 5 = 25, 25 - 9 = 16, 16 + 8 = 24! Yes!\n\nSo 5 * 5 - 9 + 8 = 25 - 9 + 8 = 16 + 8 = 24. \n\nLet me verify: 5 * 5 = 25, 25 - 9 = 16, 16 + 8 = 24. Yes!\n\nSo the expression is 5 * 5 - 9 + 8.\n"]